{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"No.  Some heroes inspire, protect.  Some people run into a burning building and save lives.  What all heroes have in common is overcoming trauma.\" he takes another puff for a even smaller knight on a horse tilting at the dragon \"pain or loss, they all have something they have to overcome.  Like the hammers on a anvil, the heat of their history forges them into the sword of their destiny.\"","created_at":"2020-08-17T10:28:15.542000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744865170370854912","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
