{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"pulls out a bottle and serves a shot to Viola \"Tis a sad story, but I think you look at it the wrong way.  They died, so that you could do something with your life.  It is painful, and that pain will never do away.  But you can use that pain, that shock, that terror, and instill it in your enemies.  You can fight so no one ever feels the way you do.  You can use those emotions in battle, fueling a need to protect, to save.  You have a decision to make right now.... Are you a victim or a hero.  Will that trauma be what defines you, or will you define it?  Will you waste the life they bought you, or use it for the greater good?\"","created_at":"2020-08-17T10:43:14.315000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744868940098043943","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
